# Contributor sync

When watching OASIS PRs or syncing contributor merges:

- On open / synchronize / clean merge / automation "already clean" reviews: sync quietly. Do not post a user-facing summary.
- Only speak when something needs the user: unresolved conflicts, typecheck/build failure after merge, a fix you pushed, or a decision that needs their input.
- Prefer `git fetch` + fast-forward; run typecheck only after a merge lands on `main`.
- Do not narrate routine status, restate automation comments, or dump PR metadata when nothing broke.
